COMMENT ON TABLE gold.equipment_oee_weekly IS 'Gold OEE grain: one row per (id_equipment, ISO week start date). Computed by stream-engine internal/rollup/grains.go by SUMMing equipment_oee_daily over date_trunc(''week'', day). Time/count columns are BIGINT (wider than the base grains) to hold week-scale sums. oee* clamped to [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds); the canonical A*P*Q reconcile makes oee = oee_a*oee_p*oee_q. (Historic amber bug: prod''s week fn wrote oee_p to the MONTH table -- fixed here.)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.id_equipment IS 'FK -> equipments. The equipment (line/sector/machine) this grain row belongs to.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.ts_value IS 'Bucket start / anchor timestamp for this grain row (part of the natural key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.oee IS 'Composite OEE ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). Equals oee_a * oee_p * oee_q (net / ideal_production headline reconciled to the A*P*Q identity). Clamped: raw >1 collapses to 1, <0 to 0.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.recalc_needed IS 'Dirty flag: true => this row will be recomputed on the next rollup tick. Cleared by the compute pass, re-set by the tail re-flag for recent/current buckets.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.oee_p IS 'Performance factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). Throughput vs ideal speed; back-solved as oee/(oee_a*oee_q) or, under the canonical reconcile, gross*available/(ideal_production*running). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.oee_a IS 'Availability factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). = running_time / scheduled-production-time (available window). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.oee_q IS 'Quality factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). = net / gross (good units over produced units). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.available_time IS 'Scheduled production time in SECONDS = SUM of daily available_time (BIGINT for week-scale sums).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.running_time IS 'Running-state time in SECONDS = SUM of daily running_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.stopped_time IS 'Stopped-state time in SECONDS = SUM of daily stopped_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.planned_downtime IS 'Planned-downtime time in SECONDS = SUM of daily planned_downtime (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.ideal_production IS 'Theoretical ideal-speed output over the available window, in COUNT units = (available_time/60) * ideal_speed. Denominator of Performance; a raw oee_p>1 means ideal_speed is set too low.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.idle_time IS 'Idle time in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_time (BIGINT). No base-grain writer populates the daily source in the new stack (dormant / 0).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.idle_starved IS 'Starvation idle in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_starved (BIGINT). Dormant / 0 in the new stack.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.idle_blocked IS 'Blocking idle in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_blocked (BIGINT). Dormant / 0 in the new stack.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.target IS 'Production target for the bucket, in COUNT units (from core.production_targets). 0 when no target; NOT overwritten while target_customized is true.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.gross IS 'Gross produced count for the bucket = SUM(gross_production_incr) from the categorical cagg. COUNT units.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.net IS 'Good (net) produced count for the bucket = SUM(net_production_incr). COUNT units. net <= gross.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.downtime IS 'Non-running time in SECONDS = SUM of daily downtime (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.changeover_time IS 'Changeover time in SECONDS = SUM of daily changeover_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.scrap IS 'Rejected/scrap count = gross - net (COALESCE 0). COUNT units.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.speed IS 'Average production speed over the bucket in COUNT-per-minute (avg of sum_speed/cnt_speed; shift grain averages state=6 buckets only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.proportional_target IS 'Elapsed-prorated production target in COUNT units for the (live) bucket. Hour = vl_day/24; shift = vl_day * (elapsed scheduled-productive time)/86400 so a live shift scales with elapsed and a completed shift settles at the full target. 0 / not overwritten when target_customized.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.target_customized IS 'If true, target / proportional_target were set manually and the rollup will NOT overwrite them.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.computed_at IS 'Wall-clock time the rollup last WROTE this row (ADR-0036 5A lineage stamp). Distinct from source_watermark.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_weekly.source_watermark IS 'Latest event-time this row has visibility through = LEAST(bucket end, now()) (ADR-0036 5A). For a replayed old bucket, computed_at is recent while this settles at the bucket end.';

COMMENT ON TABLE gold.equipment_oee_monthly IS 'Gold OEE grain: one row per (id_equipment, month start date). Computed by stream-engine internal/rollup/grains.go by SUMMing equipment_oee_daily over date_trunc(''month'', day). Time/count columns are BIGINT to hold month-scale sums. oee* clamped to [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.id_equipment IS 'FK -> equipments. The equipment (line/sector/machine) this grain row belongs to.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.ts_value IS 'Bucket start / anchor timestamp for this grain row (part of the natural key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.oee IS 'Composite OEE ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). Equals oee_a * oee_p * oee_q (net / ideal_production headline reconciled to the A*P*Q identity). Clamped: raw >1 collapses to 1, <0 to 0.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.recalc_needed IS 'Dirty flag: true => this row will be recomputed on the next rollup tick. Cleared by the compute pass, re-set by the tail re-flag for recent/current buckets.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.oee_p IS 'Performance factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). Throughput vs ideal speed; back-solved as oee/(oee_a*oee_q) or, under the canonical reconcile, gross*available/(ideal_production*running). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.oee_a IS 'Availability factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). = running_time / scheduled-production-time (available window). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.oee_q IS 'Quality factor, ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). = net / gross (good units over produced units). Clamped to [0,1].';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.available_time IS 'Scheduled production time in SECONDS = SUM of daily available_time (BIGINT for month-scale sums).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.running_time IS 'Running-state time in SECONDS = SUM of daily running_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.stopped_time IS 'Stopped-state time in SECONDS = SUM of daily stopped_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.planned_downtime IS 'Planned-downtime time in SECONDS = SUM of daily planned_downtime (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.ideal_production IS 'Theoretical ideal-speed output over the available window, in COUNT units = (available_time/60) * ideal_speed. Denominator of Performance; a raw oee_p>1 means ideal_speed is set too low.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.idle_time IS 'Idle time in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_time (BIGINT). Dormant / 0 in the new stack.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.idle_starved IS 'Starvation idle in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_starved (BIGINT). Dormant / 0 in the new stack.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.idle_blocked IS 'Blocking idle in SECONDS = SUM of daily idle_blocked (BIGINT). Dormant / 0 in the new stack.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.target IS 'Production target for the bucket, in COUNT units (from core.production_targets). 0 when no target; NOT overwritten while target_customized is true.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.gross IS 'Gross produced count for the bucket = SUM(gross_production_incr) from the categorical cagg. COUNT units.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.net IS 'Good (net) produced count for the bucket = SUM(net_production_incr). COUNT units. net <= gross.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.downtime IS 'Non-running time in SECONDS = SUM of daily downtime (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.changeover_time IS 'Changeover time in SECONDS = SUM of daily changeover_time (BIGINT).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.scrap IS 'Rejected/scrap count = gross - net (COALESCE 0). COUNT units.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.speed IS 'Average production speed over the bucket in COUNT-per-minute (avg of sum_speed/cnt_speed; shift grain averages state=6 buckets only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.proportional_target IS 'Elapsed-prorated production target in COUNT units for the (live) bucket. Hour = vl_day/24; shift = vl_day * (elapsed scheduled-productive time)/86400 so a live shift scales with elapsed and a completed shift settles at the full target. 0 / not overwritten when target_customized.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.target_customized IS 'If true, target / proportional_target were set manually and the rollup will NOT overwrite them.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.computed_at IS 'Wall-clock time the rollup last WROTE this row (ADR-0036 5A lineage stamp). Distinct from source_watermark.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_monthly.source_watermark IS 'Latest event-time this row has visibility through = LEAST(bucket end, now()) (ADR-0036 5A). For a replayed old bucket, computed_at is recent while this settles at the bucket end.';

COMMENT ON TABLE gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly IS 'Legacy reduced shift-by-week aggregate grain (one row per equipment x shift x week). Skeleton rows are seeded by the DB provision proc piot_create_equipment_oee_shift_weekly; the new-stack stream-engine does NOT compute its metric columns (no rollup value/event writer targets it) -- only unmetered.go NULLs oee* for line-metered tp=1 machines. Carries no gross/net/scrap/speed/computed_at columns. Treat metric columns as largely dormant on the new stack unless a legacy pg proc populates them.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.ts_value IS 'Bucket start / anchor timestamp for this grain row (part of the natural key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.oee IS 'OEE ratio in [0,1] (CHECK oee_bounds). Legacy shift-by-week aggregate; NOT computed by the new-stack rollup (only NULLed for line-metered machines). Treat as dormant unless a legacy pg proc writes it.';
