COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.oee_a IS 'Availability ratio in [0,1]. Legacy aggregate col; not written by the new-stack rollup (dormant).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.oee_q IS 'Quality ratio in [0,1]. Legacy aggregate col; not written by the new-stack rollup (dormant).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.available_time IS 'Scheduled production time in SECONDS = bucket wall-clock span - planned_downtime (LEAST-guarded >= 0). Denominator of Availability.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.running_time IS 'Time in the RUNNING state (equipment_events status=6) in SECONDS, capped at the bucket span (LEAST) so overlapping line/member events cannot exceed elapsed wall-clock.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.stopped_time IS 'Time in STOPPED states (equipment_events status IN (5,10,11)) in SECONDS.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.planned_downtime IS 'Time in PLANNED-downtime events in SECONDS (capped at the bucket span). Subtracted from wall-clock to yield available_time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.ideal_production IS 'Theoretical ideal-speed output over the available window, in COUNT units = (available_time/60) * ideal_speed. Denominator of Performance; a raw oee_p>1 means ideal_speed is set too low.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.idle_time IS 'Idle time in SECONDS. Summed up the grain cascade but NOT populated by any base-grain writer in the new-stack stream-engine (dormant / 0 on staging).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.idle_starved IS 'Starvation idle (no infeed) in SECONDS. Summed up the cascade only; no base-grain writer in the new stack (dormant / 0 on staging).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.idle_blocked IS 'Blocking idle (no outfeed) in SECONDS. Summed up the cascade only; no base-grain writer in the new stack (dormant / 0 on staging).';
