COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.id_shift IS 'FK -> shifts. The shift definition for this bucket (seeded from the shift calendar).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.id_shift_hour IS 'FK -> shift_hours. The specific shift-calendar row (shift x weekday expansion) for this bucket.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.id_team IS 'FK -> team assigned to this shift bucket (seeded from the shift calendar). Not written by the rollup metric passes.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN gold.equipment_oee_shift_weekly.duration IS 'Scheduled shift length (shift_size) in SECONDS, seeded from the shift calendar. Not the elapsed/running time.';
